            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[You can now hide a chat's message box when it covers part of a page. Press the down arrow in the box to fold it to a small pill with the chat's light, and press the pill to bring it back.

The bookmark on a tucked chat is now just the light. Click it to bring the chat out over the page, and click it again to put the chat back beside the page.

Tucking a chat and putting it back are now one smooth movement: the chat keeps its contents as it slides, and the page's edge moves with it.
]]></description>
